        <mxCell id="alt" value="Failure branches (shown as UML alt boxes):&#xa;• Invalid plan: show an understandable error; do not queue invalid data.&#xa;• Offline: retain local draft; status Pending; retry when online (FR-05).&#xa;• Server rejects (4xx): show reason; retain local copy; allow correction/retry.&#xa;• Same plan edited on two devices: show Keep Local / Keep Remote / Merge; facilitator chooses; never silently overwrite the local draft.&#xa;• Storage full: show save-failed cause and recovery options; do not claim a save succeeded." style="shape=note;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
